OL,3,GNEWSAFrustration for woman forced to
OL,4,Agive up home for A38
OL,5,
OL,6,FA woman forced to sell her home for a
OL,7,Fdual carriageway expansion has urged
OL,8,Fthe government to "just get on with
OL,9,Fit", after the project was shelved.
OL,11,FA total of 15 homes in Queensway Drive,
OL,12,FDerby, were compulsorily purchased as
OL,13,Fpart of the #600m A38 upgrade, which
OL,14,Fthe government said would not go ahead
OL,15,Fon Thursday, with the money saved going
OL,16,Ftowards defence spending.
OL,18,FAmong those to sell their homes was
OL,19,FGail Roberts, who said while she was
OL,20,Fnot in favour of the scheme, the
OL,21,Fdecision was disappointing due to the
OL,22,Fupheaval it had already caused.
OL,23,APub: 28-NovQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageBC Eng (E) NewsCReg TVFWeather
FL,362,360,200,160,0,100
